  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> ring; <strong>Price</strong> 5,000 gp (simple), 10,000 gp (composite); <strong>Weight</strong> —</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis simple pale stone sits atop a plain steel band, flickering every so often with unknown power. When worn by a creature who possesses a kinetic blast, add 1 damage to each damage die their simple blast deals. Stronger versions can also augment a creature’s composite blast as well as their simple blast.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Ring, creator must be a 10th level kineticist; <strong>Cost</strong> 2,500 gp (simple), 5,000 gp (composite)</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-magical-items#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
